---
// src/components/AboutCompany.astro
---

<section class="w-full bg-white py-20 md:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">

            <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 text-center lg:text-left">
                <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-[#0F2E24] tracking-tight mb-8">
                    O naszej firmie
                </h2>

                <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-600 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0">
                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Commodo arcu et at ultrices sed pretium. Mauris fermentum et consequat tortor. Tortor ultrices at quis nulla porta eget. Ullamcorper quis nunc sem rutrum nisl. Id purus purus eu tortor sed urna ac feugiat. Congue purus malesuada vulputate commodo quis eu. Id pellentesque vitae varius vitae sit et quisque.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 w-full">
                <div class="relative w-full aspect-square md:aspect-[4/3] lg:aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
                    <img
                            src="https://placehold.co/800x800/0F2E24/00A651?text=Zdjęcie+maszyny+CNC"
                            alt="Precyzyjna obróbka metalu"
                            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                    />
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>
</section>